From: EaglercraftOS <build@eaglercraftos.local>
Date: Mon, 1 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] eaglercraftos: set LOCALVERSION and default hostname hooks

Applies EaglercraftOS branding on top of vanilla 7.0.14 without touching
code: stable -eaglercraftos release string and sane defaults for the
deb-pkg build helpers.

---
 Makefile | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 VERSION = 7
 PATCHLEVEL = 0
 SUBLEVEL = 14
-EXTRAVERSION =
+EXTRAVERSION = -eaglercraftos
 NAME = EaglercraftOS Hopper

 # *DOCUMENTATION*
